[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   test case exists to demonstrate), whose "error" is observable only as the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   value printed, because `(int)` of a non-representable `double` is UB that on
