[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis I — int shape** (`printIntLine` only): `0`, `1`, `-1`, `INT_MAX`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `INT_MIN`, random `i32`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis F — float shape** (`bad`, `good`, `driver`). The code distinguishes:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | class | why the C treats it differently |
